coverage:
Method: for every chrome.storage.local record (sealed or not), I extracted its types at each tag (web-wallet/1.6.0, 1.7.0, 1.7.1, 1.7.2, 1.8.0, 1.8.1, 1.9.0, 1.9.1) and diffed them against HEAD. I diffed the record-bearing modules tag to tag (lovejoin.ts, sessions.ts, spent.ts, pending.ts, parts.ts, dapp.ts, lovejoin-pools.ts), and handlers.ts, minswap.ts, rpc.ts and core orders.rs since 1.6.0. I mapped sessions.ts's changed hunks since 1.6.0 to their methods and read the record readers among them. For ChainRecord, Withdrawing, SessionRecord, AutoRecord and PRIVATE_RECORDS I also compared 1.0.0, 1.2.0, 1.3.0, 1.4.0 and 1.5.0. I compared every release's local-key writes against reset's list, the bundled pools' head start and token list at every tag, and the history of registerOf, ownedUtxos, register.rs and accountKeys.

Read in full: private-store.ts, vault.ts, storage.ts, storage-access.ts, preferences.ts and shared/preferences.ts, accounts.ts, contacts.ts, sent-txs.ts, spent.ts, minted-by.ts, connector.ts, sw.ts, lovejoin-pools.ts, shared/histories.ts (1-150), secret-box/format.ts (header).

Read in the parts that hold or read records:
- contract-scan.ts 1-130 and 160-442;
- lovejoin.ts: the record types 929-1610; the helpers 1928-2600; chain(), fanOut and acrossOf 3600-4145; adaPool through tailChain 4262-4500; chainEnded through cuts 5640-5900; sortOut 5968-6107; found, made, lookUp, madeBy, inputsOf, accountKeys and keysOf 6129-6360; dropWithdrawing through read and update 7750-8048;
- sessions.ts: the types 296-725, the helpers 1036-1140, stillWatched 2596-2660, the runner's freeing 3715-3760, buildBack 4495-4700, the reserve and Lovejoin helpers and fundingChange 4815-5070, book, save and update 6236-6316, wayOf through autoView 6395-6545;
- pending.ts 1-160 and its sealed reads by grep;
- activity.ts 80-130, 240-300, 380-470 and 640-670;
- wallet.ts 20-170, 455-500 and 690-725; balances.ts ownedUtxos; chain.ts registerOf; private-index.ts IndexRow and utxoOf; tests lovejoin-accounts.test.ts 182-224 and the test names of the update suites.

Not read line by line: the rest of sessions.ts and lovejoin.ts (their lanes did), dapp.ts beyond its Connected record, parts.ts beyond its diffs, koios.ts, the UI and the WebAssembly beyond PoolRef and the reward request. I ran no tests and no browser; the Chrome update behaviour is the documented one.
